OL,3,GNEWSAFamily mourns girl with the
OL,4,A'biggest smile'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family mourning the loss of a
OL,7,F15-year-old girl who died in a crash
OL,8,Flast week have said her "contagious
OL,9,Flaugh" and "biggest smile" will be
OL,10,Fmissed forever.
OL,12,FCharlie Olivia Slack was a passenger in
OL,13,Fa Fiat 500 which was involved in a
OL,14,Fcrash on Shincliffe Lane, to the east
OL,15,Fof Durham.
OL,17,FShe was pronounced dead at the scene,
OL,18,Fwhile a second passenger in the car was
OL,19,Ftaken to University Hospital North
OL,20,FDurham for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
