OL,3,GNEWSAFamily mourns girl with the
OL,4,A'biggest smile'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Charlie's family said
OL,7,F"Your beautiful face is everywhere we
OL,8,Fturn. Fifteen years is only a short
OL,9,Flifetime in which to fulfil your dreams
OL,10,Fand conquer the world."
